{"id":"16c21dd75037745e71b32cf899927319bbc63a54","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"16c21dd75037745e71b32cf899927319bbc63a54","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"api/envoy/admin/v3/config_dump.proto","lines":["@@ -35,6 +35,7 @@ message ConfigDump {","   // * ``ecds_filter_http``: :ref:`EcdsConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.EcdsConfigDump>`","   // * ``ecds_filter_quic_listener``: :ref:`EcdsConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.EcdsConfigDump>`","   // * ``ecds_filter_tcp_listener``: :ref:`EcdsConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.EcdsConfigDump>`","+  // * ``ecds_modules``: :ref:`EcdsConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.EcdsConfigDump>` for bootstrap dynamic modules","   // * ``endpoints``:  :ref:`EndpointsConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.EndpointsConfigDump>`","   // * ``listeners``: :ref:`ListenersConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.ListenersConfigDump>`","   // * ``scoped_routes``: :ref:`ScopedRoutesConfigDump <envoy_v3_api_msg_admin.v3.ScopedRoutesConfigDump>`","@@ -43,8 +44,7 @@ message ConfigDump {","   //","   // EDS Configuration will only be dumped by using parameter ``?include_eds``","   //","-  // Currently ECDS is supported in HTTP and listener filters. Note, ECDS configuration for","-  // either HTTP or listener filter will only be dumped if it is actually configured.","+  // ECDS configurations are dumped only when configured.","   //","   // You can filter output with the resource and mask query parameters.","   // See :ref:`/config_dump?resource={} <operations_admin_interface_config_dump_by_resource>`,"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"changelogs/current/new_features/dynamic_modules__bootstrap_ecds.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@","+Added ``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_subscribe_ecds`` and","+``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update``, with Rust SDK ``subscribe_ecds`` and","+``on_ecds_update``, for :ref:`bootstrap extension configuration over ECDS","+<config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_ecds>`. Conflicting filter ECDS subscriptions on ADS","+are refused."],"additions":5,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/other_features/bootstrap_extensions/dynamic_modules.rst","lines":["@@ -215,6 +215,67 @@ prefix, tagged with ``config_name`` set to the extension name, or ``default`` if","   listeners_owned, Gauge, Listeners that the module owns","   updates_pending, Gauge, Writes that are queued or warming or that wait for the workers to start"," ","+.. _config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_ecds:","+","+ECDS Configuration","+------------------","+","+A module calls ``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_subscribe_ecds`` after server","+initialization to subscribe to one named","+:ref:`TypedExtensionConfig <envoy_v3_api_msg_config.core.v3.TypedExtensionConfig>` resource. It","+passes a JSON-encoded :ref:`ExtensionConfigSource","+<envoy_v3_api_msg_config.core.v3.ExtensionConfigSource>` with its configuration source and allowed","+``type_urls``. Default configurations and wildcard names are not supported. Another bootstrap","+extension cannot use the same ADS or xDS-TP name. Filter ECDS subscriptions conflict only on ADS.","+The first subscriber keeps the name until its subscription ends. The bootstrap subscription ends","+when shutdown begins.","+","+``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update`` receives the resource name, version,","+payload type, encoding and configuration on the main thread. ``Struct`` and ``TypedStruct.value``","+arrive as JSON, ``StringValue`` and ``BytesValue`` as unwrapped bytes, and other messages as","+protobuf bytes. xDS-TP names have sorted context parameters. Filesystem updates without","+``version_info`` have an empty version.","+","+For types that Envoy does not link, use ``TypedStruct``, or send binary payloads as ``BytesValue``;","+an accepted payload that Envoy cannot render fails the whole unfiltered config dump. Identical","+resends and empty state-of-the-world updates do not invoke the hook.","+","+The hook must not block. Rejecting an update keeps the previous configuration and NACKs the","+response, which may contain other ECDS resources and may have been partly applied. Explicit","+removals and TTL expiry invoke the hook without a configuration. Delta can report a missing","+resource as a removal before any configuration arrives. A rejected removal is only logged and","+keeps the previous configuration. A connection failure keeps the last configuration unless its","+TTL expires.","+","+Filesystem sources can invoke the hook before the subscription call returns, so do not hold a","+lock across the call that the hook takes. Initial fetch failures do not invoke the hook. A module","+that waits for its first configuration before signaling initialization complete must set its own","+startup timeout.","+","+The ``ecds_modules`` config dump key lists accepted bootstrap configurations with their version","+and update time. Subscription statistics use the","+``extension_config_discovery.bootstrap.<resource_name>.<extension_name>.`` prefix, tagged with","+``config_name`` set to the extension name, or ``default`` if it is empty, when explicit stats tags","+are enabled.","+","+A refused removal still increments ``update_success`` and updates the subscription version.","+On TTL expiry, ``version_text`` becomes empty. The module and config dump keep their previous","+configuration.","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: Name, Type, Description","+  :widths: 1, 1, 2","+","+  init_fetch_timeout, Counter, Initial configuration fetches that timed out","+  update_attempt, Counter, Configuration fetch attempts","+  update_failure, Counter, Configuration fetch failures","+  update_rejected, Counter, Rejected configuration updates","+  update_success, Counter, Successful subscription updates including unchanged resends and refused removals","+  update_time, Gauge, Time of the last successful subscription update in milliseconds since the epoch","+  update_duration, Histogram, Time spent processing updates in milliseconds","+  version, Gauge, Hash of the last successful subscription version","+  version_text, TextReadout, Last successful subscription version","+"," .. _config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_config_snapshots:"," "," Configuration Snapshots"],"additions":61,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/overview/extension.rst","lines":["@@ -40,6 +40,14 @@ management server<xds_protocol>` using :ref:`ExtensionConfiguration discovery"," service<envoy_v3_api_file_envoy/service/extension/v3/config_discovery.proto>`."," The name field in the extension configuration acts as the resource identifier."," ","+Bootstrap dynamic modules","+^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+:ref:`Bootstrap dynamic modules <config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_ecds>` can subscribe","+to ECDS. Their ADS and xDS-TP names cannot be shared with another bootstrap module. Filter ECDS","+subscriptions conflict with bootstrap subscriptions only on ADS. The first subscriber keeps","+the name until its subscription ends; later conflicting subscriptions are refused.","+"," Listener filters"," ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^"," "],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/common/config/BUILD","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,21 @@ licenses([\"notice\"])  # Apache 2"," "," envoy_package()"," ","+envoy_cc_library(","+    name = \"ecds_subscription_registry_lib\",","+    srcs = [\"ecds_subscription_registry.cc\"],","+    hdrs = [\"ecds_subscription_registry.h\"],","+    deps = [","+        \":xds_resource_lib\",","+        \"//envoy/singleton:instance_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/singleton:manager_interface\",","+        \"//source/common/common:cleanup_lib\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/container:flat_hash_map\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/status:statusor\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","+    ],","+)","+"," envoy_cc_library(","     name = \"api_version_lib\",","     hdrs = [\"api_version.h\"],"],"additions":15,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/common/config/ecds_subscription_registry.cc","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@","+#include \"source/common/config/ecds_subscription_registry.h\"","+","+#include \"envoy/singleton/manager.h\"","+","+#include \"source/common/config/xds_resource.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/strings/str_cat.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Config {","+","+SINGLETON_MANAGER_REGISTRATION(ecds_subscription_registry);","+","+std::shared_ptr<EcdsSubscriptionRegistry>","+EcdsSubscriptionRegistry::get(Singleton::Manager& manager) {","+  return manager.getTyped<EcdsSubscriptionRegistry>(","+      SINGLETON_MANAGER_REGISTERED_NAME(ecds_subscription_registry),","+      [] { return std::make_shared<EcdsSubscriptionRegistry>(); });","+}","+","+absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<Cleanup>> EcdsSubscriptionRegistry::reserve(absl::string_view name,","+                                                                           Sharing sharing) {","+  auto normalized = XdsResourceIdentifier::normalizeResourceName(name);","+  RETURN_IF_NOT_OK(normalized.status());","+  auto [it, inserted] = names_.try_emplace(*normalized, Entry{sharing, 0});","+  if (!inserted && (sharing == Sharing::Exclusive || it->second.sharing == Sharing::Exclusive)) {","+    return absl::AlreadyExistsError(absl::StrCat(","+        \"ECDS resource '\", name, \"' already has a \",","+        it->second.sharing == Sharing::Exclusive ? \"bootstrap module\" : \"filter\", \" subscription\"));","+  }","+  ++it->second.count;","+  return std::make_unique<Cleanup>([self = shared_from_this(), name = std::move(*normalized)] {","+    auto it = self->names_.find(name);","+    if (--it->second.count == 0) {","+      self->names_.erase(it);","+    }","+  });","+}","+","+} // namespace Config","+} // namespace Envoy"],"additions":41,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/common/config/ecds_subscription_registry.h","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@","+#pragma once","+","+#include <cstddef>","+#include <memory>","+#include <string>","+","+#include \"envoy/singleton/instance.h\"","+#include \"envoy/singleton/manager.h\"","+","+#include \"source/common/common/cleanup.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/container/flat_hash_map.h\"","+#include \"absl/status/statusor.h\"","+#include \"absl/strings/string_view.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Config {","+","+/**","+ * Prevents exclusive ECDS subscriptions from sharing a resource with another consumer.","+ */","+class EcdsSubscriptionRegistry : public Singleton::Instance,","+                                 public std::enable_shared_from_this<EcdsSubscriptionRegistry> {","+public:","+  enum class Sharing { Shared, Exclusive };","+","+  static std::shared_ptr<EcdsSubscriptionRegistry> get(Singleton::Manager& manager);","+","+  absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<Cleanup>> reserve(absl::string_view name, Sharing sharing);","+","+private:","+  struct Entry {","+    Sharing sharing;","+    size_t count;","+  };","+  absl::flat_hash_map<std::string, Entry> names_;","+};","+","+} // namespace Config","+} // namespace Envoy"],"additions":40,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/common/filter/BUILD","lines":["@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","         \"//envoy/stats:stats_macros\",","         \"//envoy/thread_local:thread_local_interface\",","         \"//source/common/common:containers_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:ecds_subscription_registry_lib\",","         \"//source/common/config:resource_type_helper_lib\",","         \"//source/common/config:utility_lib\",","         \"//source/common/grpc:common_lib\","],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/common/filter/config_discovery_impl.cc","lines":["@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@"," "," #include \"source/common/common/containers.h\""," #include \"source/common/common/thread.h\"","+#include \"source/common/config/ecds_subscription_registry.h\""," #include \"source/common/grpc/common.h\""," #include \"source/common/protobuf/utility.h\""," ","@@ -66,11 +67,20 @@ absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<FilterConfigSubscription>> FilterConfigSubscripti","     Upstream::ClusterManager& cluster_manager, const std::string& stat_prefix,","     std::shared_ptr<FilterConfigProviderManagerImplBase> filter_config_provider_manager,","     const std::string& subscription_id) {","+  std::unique_ptr<Cleanup> name_reservation;","+  if (config_source.has_ads()) {","+    auto reservation =","+        Config::EcdsSubscriptionRegistry::get(factory_context.singletonManager())","+            ->reserve(filter_config_name, Config::EcdsSubscriptionRegistry::Sharing::Shared);","+    RETURN_IF_NOT_OK(reservation.status());","+    name_reservation = std::move(*reservation);","+  }","   absl::Status creation_status = absl::OkStatus();","   auto ret = std::unique_ptr<FilterConfigSubscription>(new FilterConfigSubscription(","       config_source, filter_config_name, factory_context, cluster_manager, stat_prefix,","       filter_config_provider_manager, subscription_id, creation_status));","   RETURN_IF_NOT_OK_REF(creation_status);","+  ret->ecds_name_reservation_ = std::move(name_reservation);","   return ret;"," }"," FilterConfigSubscription::FilterConfigSubscription("],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/common/filter/config_discovery_impl.h","lines":["@@ -499,6 +499,8 @@ class FilterConfigSubscription : public Config::SubscriptionCallbacks,","   absl::flat_hash_set<DynamicFilterConfigProviderImplBase*> filter_config_providers_;","   friend class DynamicFilterConfigProviderImplBase;"," ","+  std::unique_ptr<Cleanup> ecds_name_reservation_;","+","   // This must be the last since its destructor may call out to stats to report","   // on draining requests.","   std::unique_ptr<Config::Subscription> subscription_;"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/BUILD","lines":["@@ -109,6 +109,40 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     ],"," )"," ","+envoy_cc_library(","+    name = \"extension_config_subscription_lib\",","+    srcs = [\"extension_config_subscription.cc\"],","+    hdrs = [\"extension_config_subscription.h\"],","+    deps = [","+        \"//envoy/config:subscription_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/config:xds_manager_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:admin_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:config_tracker_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:factory_context_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/singleton:instance_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/singleton:manager_interface\",","+        \"//source/common/common:cleanup_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/common:logger_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/common:matchers_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:ecds_subscription_registry_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:resource_name_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:resource_type_helper_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:utility_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/config:xds_resource_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/protobuf:utility_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/stats:utility_lib\",","+        \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/container:flat_hash_set\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/status\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/status:statusor\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","+        \"@envoy_api//envoy/admin/v3:pkg_cc_proto\",","+        \"@envoy_api//envoy/config/core/v3:pkg_cc_proto\",","+        \"@xds//udpa/type/v1:pkg_cc_proto\",","+        \"@xds//xds/type/v3:pkg_cc_proto\",","+    ],","+)","+"," envoy_cc_library(","     name = \"extension_config_lib\",","     srcs = [\"extension_config.cc\"],","@@ -116,6 +150,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     deps = [","         \":cluster_writer_lib\",","         \":config_snapshot_lib\",","+        \":extension_config_subscription_lib\",","         \":listener_writer_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:optref_lib\",","         \"//envoy/event:dispatcher_interface\",","@@ -135,6 +170,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","         \"//source/common/common:thread_lib\",","         \"//source/common/http:message_lib\",","         \"//source/common/init:target_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/protobuf:utility_lib\",","         \"//source/common/stats:utility_lib\",","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:dynamic_modules_lib\",","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:metric_registry\","],"additions":36,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/abi_impl.cc","lines":["@@ -737,6 +737,18 @@ bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_remove_admin_handler(","   return admin->removeHandler(prefix_str);"," }"," ","+bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_subscribe_ecds(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr config_envoy_ptr,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer name,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer source_json) {","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return false;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(config_envoy_ptr);","+  return config->subscribeEcds({name.ptr, name.length}, {source_json.ptr, source_json.length});","+}","+"," envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result"," envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_new(","     envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr config_envoy_ptr,"],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.cc","lines":["@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@"," #include \"source/common/common/matchers.h\""," #include \"source/common/common/regex.h\""," #include \"source/common/common/thread.h\"","+#include \"source/common/protobuf/utility.h\""," "," #include \"absl/container/flat_hash_set.h\""," #include \"absl/strings/str_cat.h\"","@@ -46,6 +47,7 @@ DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig("," }"," "," DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::~DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig() {","+  extension_config_subscription_.reset();","   // Cancel any pending HTTP callouts before destroying the config.","   for (auto& callout : http_callouts_) {","     if (callout.second->request_ != nullptr) {","@@ -105,6 +107,65 @@ bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableClusterLifecycle() {","   return true;"," }"," ","+bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::subscribeEcds(absl::string_view name,","+                                                          absl::string_view source_json) {","+  if (!server_initialized_) {","+    ENVOY_LOG(error, \"cannot subscribe to bootstrap ECDS before server is initialized\");","+    return false;","+  }","+  if (extension_destroyed_ || !shutdownNotificationExpected()) {","+    ENVOY_LOG(error, \"cannot subscribe to bootstrap ECDS after shutdown or in init only mode\");","+    return false;","+  }","+  if (extension_config_subscription_ != nullptr) {","+    ENVOY_LOG(error, \"bootstrap extension {} is already subscribed to ECDS\", extension_name_);","+    return false;","+  }","+  if (on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update_ == nullptr) {","+    ENVOY_LOG(error, \"bootstrap extension {} has no ECDS update hook\", extension_name_);","+    return false;","+  }","+  envoy::config::core::v3::ExtensionConfigSource source;","+  bool has_unknown_field = false;","+  auto status = MessageUtil::loadFromJsonNoThrow(source_json, source, has_unknown_field);","+  if (!status.ok()) {","+    ENVOY_LOG(warn, \"bootstrap ECDS config source for {} is invalid: {}\", name, status.message());","+    return false;","+  }","+  TRY_ASSERT_MAIN_THREAD {","+    auto subscription = ExtensionConfigSubscription::create(","+        name, source, extension_name_, context_,","+        [this](absl::string_view resource_name, absl::string_view version,","+               absl::string_view type_url,","+               envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_ecds_config_encoding encoding,","+               std::optional<absl::string_view> config) {","+          const bool previous = std::exchange(in_resource_lifecycle_callback, true);","+          Cleanup cleanup([previous]() { in_resource_lifecycle_callback = previous; });","+          return on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update_(","+              thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_, {resource_name.data(), resource_name.size()},","+              {version.data(), version.size()}, {type_url.data(), type_url.size()}, encoding,","+              config.has_value(),","+              config.has_value()","+                  ? envoy_dynamic_module_type_envoy_buffer{config->data(), config->size()}","+                  : envoy_dynamic_module_type_envoy_buffer{nullptr, 0});","+        });","+    if (!subscription.ok()) {","+      ENVOY_LOG(warn, \"cannot subscribe to bootstrap ECDS config {}: {}\", name,","+                subscription.status().message());","+      return false;","+    }","+    extension_config_subscription_ = std::move(subscription.value());","+    extension_config_subscription_->start();","+    return true;","+  }","+  END_TRY","+  CATCH(const EnvoyException& exception, {","+    ENVOY_LOG(warn, \"cannot subscribe to bootstrap ECDS config {}: {}\", name, exception.what());","+    extension_config_subscription_.reset();","+    return false;","+  });","+}","+"," absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<ConfigSnapshot>>"," DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::getConfigSnapshot(","     absl::Span<const absl::string_view> providers, absl::string_view name_regex) {","@@ -370,6 +431,7 @@ void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onPostInit() {"," "," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onShutdown() {","   shutdown_started_ = true;","+  extension_config_subscription_.reset();","   if (cluster_writer_ != nullptr) {","     cluster_writer_->onShutdown();","   }","@@ -644,6 +706,11 @@ newDynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig("," ","   // The module constructor can enable the writers, which capture their done hooks, so the optional","   // hooks are resolved first.","+  auto on_ecds_update =","+      config->dynamic_module_->getFunctionPointer<OnBootstrapExtensionEcdsUpdateType>(","+          \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update\");","+  config->on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update_ =","+      on_ecds_update.ok() ? on_ecds_update.value() : nullptr;","   auto on_worker_event =","       config->dynamic_module_->getFunctionPointer<OnBootstrapExtensionWorkerEventType>(","           \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_worker_event\");"],"additions":67,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.h","lines":["@@ -19,6 +19,7 @@"," #include \"source/common/init/target_impl.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/cluster_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/config_snapshot.h\"","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config_subscription.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/listener_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/dynamic_modules.h\"","@@ -75,6 +76,8 @@ using OnBootstrapExtensionClusterWriterUpdateDoneType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionListenerWriterUpdateDoneType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done);","+using OnBootstrapExtensionEcdsUpdateType =","+    decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeBoolUpdateType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_runtime_bool_update);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeIntUpdateType =","@@ 